<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>¡Confirma tu registro en la Feria Gamer!</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f9f9fb;
      color: #333;
      padding: 24px 8px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .container {
      background-color: #fff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px 30px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(102, 68, 255, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-in-out;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 120px;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
    }

    .title {
      text-align: center;
      color: #5a3aff;
      font-size: 1.8em;
      margin-top: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    p {
      line-height: 1.6;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.05em;
      color: #444;
    }

    strong {
      color: #5a3aff;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      margin: 18px auto;
      background-color: #7a42ff;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 25px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      font-size: 1em;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: scale(1.04);
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(142, 45, 226, 0.5);
    }

    .footer {
      font-size: 0.85em;
      color: #777;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 35px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      padding-top: 15px;
    }

    a:visited {
      color: inherit;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(10px);
      }

      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .container {
        padding: 10vw 2vw;
        max-width: 98vw;
      }

      .logo {
        width: 80px;
      }

      .title {
        font-size: 1.1em;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 0.95em;
        color: #444;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .button {
        padding: 10px 10vw;
        font-size: 0.95em;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <img
      src="https://gamerlab.blob.core.windows.net/gamer-storage-container/1761518831579-Arkad_circle_email_png-01.png?sv=2025-11-05&se=2030-10-26T04%3A20%3A32Z&sr=b&sp=r&sig=OLbpHQRtTkjePpHmkSKgPi4pXq2oeZdubRc8p8akIOk%3D"
      alt="Logo Arkad" class="logo" />

    <h2 class="title">¡Bienvenid@ a la Feria Gamer!</h2>

    <p>Estás a un paso de vivir la experiencia más esperada del semestre.</p>

    <p>
      <strong>📅 Fecha:</strong> {{eventDate}}<br />
      <strong>🕗 Hora:</strong> 8:00 am - 12:00 pm<br />
      <strong>📍 Lugar:</strong> Coliseo Universidad del Norte
    </p>

    <p>
      Confirma tu registro para participar en el evento.<br />
      Tienes <strong>24 horas</strong> para completar tu confirmación antes de que el enlace expire.
    </p>

    <p style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="{{confirmationURL}}" class="button" style="
            background-color: #7a42ff;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none !important;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 16px 36px;
            margin: 25px auto;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
          ">
        Confirmar Registro
      </a>
    </p>

    <p class="footer">© 2025 Arkad · Todos los derechos reservados</p>
  </div>
</body>

</html>